cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Onibex ASK: Agentic Semantic Knowledge"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic Text-to-SQL agent and its accompanying YAML specification
  for AI-ready SAP data products. The platform resolves natural-language
  questions against a curated semantic layer (Bronze/Silver/Gold) via
  OpenSearch hybrid search and a deterministic entity-relationship graph,
  compiling SQL from resolved fields rather than letting the LLM invent
  table or column names.
